                     <watermark xml:id="watermark_0a6faf4f">at the top centre of the bifolio the countermark '&amp; | Zoonen' (J. Honig and Zoonen) is partly visible. Paper of a fairly dense quality.</watermark>
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_f3a60d21">In 2<rend xml:id="idm81" rend="sup">o</rend>; upright format; music (fols. 1r–2v); in all a single bifolio. Hand-ruled paper, 14 staves (10mm; 14-stave (?) rastrum used) in light brown ink and music in black ink; bottom stave on fol. 2r has not been used. A clean copy with only a single correction in ink. Bar numbers added in a more recent pencil, presumably in connection with the preparation of a modern transcription; the total number of bars of each movement noted in red pencil at the final bars, most likely an early, near-contemporary addition.</physMedium>
